<title>UK: Polypipe chairman McDonald sells shares.</title>
<headline>Polypipe chairman McDonald sells shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plastic pipemaker Polypipe Plc said on Thursday its chairman, Kevin McDonald, sold 3.0 million ordinary shares in the company at 202p per share.</p>
<p>McDonald sold the shares mainly to pay a tax bill, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Polypipe's shares were off 2.0p at 206p in morning trade.</p>
<p>Of the shares sold, 608,500 resulted from the exercise of share options at various prices ranging from 50.5p to 143.5p.</p>
</text>
